/T (ILERA EKO DAY continues to make an impact across communities in Lagos State, bringing healthcare awareness and social health insurance information closer to residents. The initiative provided an opportunity for the Lagos State Health Management Agency \(LASHMA\) to engage directly with residents, answer questions, create awareness about ILERA EKO, and highlight the importance of accessible and affordable healthcare coverage for individuals and families. ILERA EKO Day was packed with fun, learning, and engaging activities. From Flip the Bottle and Fastest Finger games to health talks, medical check-ups, and one-on-one conversations, residents had the opportunity to interact with the LASHMA team, share their concerns, and get answers to their questions about ILERA EKO.)
/E (ILERA EKO DAY continues to make an impact across communities in Lagos State, bringing healthcare awareness and social health insurance information closer to residents. The initiative provided an opportunity for the Lagos State Health Management Agency \(LASHMA\) to engage directly with residents, answer questions, create awareness about ILERA EKO, and highlight the importance of accessible and affordable healthcare coverage for individuals and families. ILERA EKO Day was packed with fun, learning, and engaging activities. From Flip the Bottle and Fastest Finger games to health talks, medical check-ups, and one-on-one conversations, residents had the opportunity to interact with the LASHMA team, share their concerns, and get answers to their questions about ILERA EKO.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
