/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (LASHMA commenced its Q3 Healthcare Provider \(HCP\) Engagement Meeting at the LASHMA Conference Room, bringing together healthcare providers from 10 Local Government Areas \(LGAs\) across Lagos State.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The engagement provided a platform to review key issues impacting service delivery and strengthen collaboration between LASHMA and its network of healthcare providers. Discussions focused on supply-side enrolment, emergency care coordination under LASHMA-AID, clinical audit, statutory documentation, policy updates, pre-authorisation processes, and the finalized Service Charter.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The session also featured an interactive discussion, giving healthcare providers the opportunity to share their experiences, raise concerns, ask questions, and provide practical feedback on ways to improve service delivery for ILERA EKO enrollees.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
467 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
