/E (As the third quarter of 2026 comes to a close, we are encouraged by the momentum recorded in our efforts to expand health insurance coverage and improve access to quality healthcare across Lagos State. The quarter has provided opportunities to strengthen collaboration with stakeholders, take health insurance awareness closer to communities, and support efforts to increase understanding and participation in ILERA EKO.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
633 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (Our progress continues to be driven by the collective efforts of the Lagos State Health Management Agency, our healthcare providers, partners, stakeholders, and dedicated staff. Their commitment has remained instrumental in translating our vision for a more inclusive and responsive health financing system into meaningful action.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
634 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (In the final quarter of the year, we will continue to build on these efforts by strengthening community engagement, improving service delivery, and pursuing practical approaches that support greater enrolment and sustained access to healthcare for residents across Lagos State.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
635 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (We appreciate your continued partnership and commitment to the ILERA EKO journey. Together, we are taking important steps towards a healthier and more financially protected Lagos.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
