639 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (I want to thank God and ILERA EKO  because I registered on my first year and I never knew i was going to have an emergency CS, and ILERA covered my CS, everything, even the blood, thank you so much Gov Sanwo-olu and PS LASHMA.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
640 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (I want to use this opportunity to thank LASHMA and Lagos state Government for saving my life, and for giving me hope for being alive and to focus for the future, because I had an accident at 3rd Mainland bridge and immediately the ambulance was called they responded to pick me up. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [17 19 18]
>>
endobj
641 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (I started using ILERA since I got pregnant, and it has been really awesome, even until now that I had my baby already, the experience has really been awesome, and I will like to thank LASHMA and Lagos State Government for this. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
