/Title (At the heart of ILERA EKO DAY is a simple message: healthcare should not feel far away. It should be accessible, affordable, and available to everyone. We appreciate all the communities and residents who welcomed the initiative, participated in the engagements, and continue to support the journey towards Universal Health Coverage \(UHC\) in Lagos State.)
